{"id":"CH-Calls","title":"8. 各种类型的调用、链接与热代码加载","html":"<div class=\"sect1\"> <h2 id=\"CH-Calls\"><a class=\"link\" data-ref=\"CH-Calls\" href=\"#CH-Calls\">8. 各种类型的调用、链接与热代码加载</a></h2> <div class=\"sectionbody\"> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>BEAM 中的函数调用可以划分为不同的类型。</p> </div> <div class=\"sect2\"> <h3 id=\"_local_calls\"><a class=\"link\" data-ref=\"_local_calls\" href=\"#_local_calls\">8.1. 本地调用</a></h3> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>本地调用是指在同一个模块内调用函数、且不显式指定模块名的情况。这类调用在编译期就已解析，并保证在调用者所在的同一模块版本中执行。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>示例：</p> </div> <div class=\"listingblock\"> <div class=\"content\"> <pre class=\"rouge highlight\"><code data-lang=\"erlang\"><span class=\"nf\">foo</span><span class=\"p\">()</span> <span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span> <span class=\"nf\">bar</span><span class=\"p\">().</span> <span class=\"err\">%</span> <span class=\"nv\">Local</span> <span class=\"n\">call</span> <span class=\"n\">within</span> <span class=\"n\">the</span> <span class=\"n\">same</span> <span class=\"n\">module</span></code></pre> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"sect2\"> <h3 id=\"_remote_calls\"><a class=\"link\" data-ref=\"_remote_calls\" href=\"#_remote_calls\">8.2. 远程调用</a></h3> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>远程调用会显式指定模块名，从而确保使用该模块已加载的最新版本。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>示例：</p> </div> <div class=\"listingblock\"> <div class=\"content\"> <pre class=\"rouge highlight\"><code data-lang=\"erlang\"><span class=\"nf\">foo</span><span class=\"p\">()</span> <span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span> <span class=\"o\">?</span><span class=\"nv\">MODULE</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nf\">bar</span><span class=\"p\">().</span> <span class=\"err\">%</span> <span class=\"nv\">Remote</span> <span class=\"n\">call</span> <span class=\"n\">ensuring</span> <span class=\"n\">latest</span> <span class=\"n\">module</span> <span class=\"n\">version</span></code></pre> </div> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>远程调用为 <strong>热代码加载</strong> 提供了支持，使模块无需重启系统即可在线更新。</p> </div> </div> <div class=\"sect2\"> <h3 id=\"_code_loading\"><a class=\"link\" data-ref=\"_code_loading\" href=\"#_code_loading\">8.3. 代码加载</a></h3> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>在 Erlang 运行时系统中，代码加载由 code server 处理。code server 会调用 <code>erlang</code> 模块中更底层的 BIF 来完成实际的加载，同时它也决定清除（purge）策略。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>运行时系统可以为每个模块保留两个版本：<em>current</em> 版本和 <em>old</em> 版本。所有完全限定（远程）调用都会进入当前版本。旧版本中的本地调用以及栈上的返回地址仍然可以指向旧版本。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>如果加载了某个模块的第三个版本，而仍有进程在运行（栈上仍持有指向旧代码的指针），代码服务器（code server）就会杀掉这些进程并清除旧代码。之后，当前版本会变成旧版本，而第三个版本会作为当前版本被加载。</p> </div> </div> <div class=\"sect2\"> <h3 id=\"_hot_code_loading\"><a class=\"link\" data-ref=\"_hot_code_loading\" href=\"#_hot_code_loading\">8.4. 热代码加载</a></h3> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>正如我们所看到的，本地函数调用与远程函数调用之间不仅存在语法差异，还存在语义差异。远程调用（或称“完全限定调用”，fully qualified call）指的是对具名模块中函数的调用，它保证会进入该模块最新加载的版本。本地调用指的是对同一模块内函数的非限定调用，它保证会进入与调用者相同的代码版本。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>只要在调用点指定模块名，对本地函数的调用就可以变成远程调用。这通常借助 <code>?MODULE</code> 宏来完成，如 <code>?MODULE:foo()</code> 所示。对非本地模块的远程调用则无法变成本地调用，也就是说，没有任何办法保证被调用者与调用者处于同一代码版本。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>这是 Erlang 的一个重要特性，正是它让 <em>热代码加载</em>或 <em>热升级</em>成为可能。只要确保服务器循环的某处存在一个远程调用，就可以在系统运行期间把新代码加载进系统；当执行到达该远程调用时，就会切换到执行新代码。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>编写服务器循环的一种常见做法是：主循环采用本地调用，代码升级处理器则执行远程调用，并可能执行状态升级：</p> </div> <div class=\"listingblock\"> <div class=\"content\"> <pre class=\"rouge highlight\"><code data-lang=\"erlang\"><span class=\"nf\">loop</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nv\">State</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"k\">receive</span>\n    <span class=\"n\">upgrade</span> <span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span>\n       <span class=\"c\">%% Force a call to the latest version of the code.\n</span>       <span class=\"nv\">NewState</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"o\">?</span><span class=\"nv\">MODULE</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nf\">code_upgrade</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nv\">State</span><span class=\"p\">),</span>\n       <span class=\"o\">?</span><span class=\"nv\">MODULE</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nf\">loop</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nv\">NewState</span><span class=\"p\">);</span>\n     <span class=\"nv\">Msg</span> <span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span>\n       <span class=\"c\">%% In other cases we call the old version of the code.\n</span>       <span class=\"c\">%% That is the version of the code that also handles old data.\n</span>       <span class=\"nv\">NewState</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"nf\">handle_msg</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nv\">Msg</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"nv\">State</span><span class=\"p\">),</span>\n       <span class=\"nf\">loop</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nv\">NewState</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n   <span class=\"k\">end</span><span class=\"p\">.</span></code></pre> </div> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>借助这种结构（<code>gen_server</code> 基本上采用的就是它），程序员可以控制代码升级的时机和方式。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>热代码升级是 Erlang 最重要的特性之一，它使得编写年复一年 7×24 小时不间断运行的服务器成为可能。它也是 Erlang 采用动态类型的主要原因之一。在静态类型语言中，很难为 <code>code_upgrade</code> 函数给出类型。（同样也很难给出循环函数的类型。）随着 State 的类型为了支持新特性而改变，这些类型将来也会随之变化。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>不过，对于关心性能的语言实现者来说，热代码加载功能是一种负担。由于对远程模块的每次调用以及来自远程模块的每次调用，将来都可能切换到新代码，因此跨模块边界做全程序优化非常困难。（困难但并非不可能，已有一些解决方案，但到目前为止我还没见过哪一个被完整实现。）</p> </div> </div> <div class=\"sect2\"> <h3 id=\"_closure_calls\"><a class=\"link\" data-ref=\"_closure_calls\" href=\"#_closure_calls\">8.5. 闭包调用</a></h3> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>Erlang 中的闭包允许把函数当作值传递，并捕获其定义作用域中的变量。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>示例：</p> </div> <div class=\"listingblock\"> <div class=\"content\"> <pre class=\"rouge highlight\"><code data-lang=\"erlang\"><span class=\"nf\">make_adder</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nv\">N</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span> <span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nv\">X</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span> <span class=\"nv\">X</span> <span class=\"o\">+</span> <span class=\"nv\">N</span> <span class=\"k\">end</span><span class=\"p\">.</span></code></pre> </div> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>调用闭包</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>闭包一旦创建，就可以像其他任何函数一样被调用。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>示例：</p> </div> <div class=\"listingblock\"> <div class=\"content\"> <pre class=\"rouge highlight\"><code data-lang=\"erlang\"><span class=\"nv\">Adder</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"nf\">make_adder</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">5</span><span class=\"p\">),</span>\n<span class=\"nv\">Result</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"nv\">Adder</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"p\">).</span> <span class=\"err\">%</span> <span class=\"nv\">Returns</span> <span class=\"mi\">15</span></code></pre> </div> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>将闭包作为参数传递</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>闭包可以传给高阶函数，从而实现更灵活的行为。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>示例：</p> </div> <div class=\"listingblock\"> <div class=\"content\"> <pre class=\"rouge highlight\"><code data-lang=\"erlang\"><span class=\"nf\">apply_fun</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nv\">F</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"nv\">X</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span> <span class=\"nv\">F</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nv\">X</span><span class=\"p\">).</span>\n\n<span class=\"nv\">Result</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"nf\">apply_fun</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nf\">make_adder</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">),</span> <span class=\"mi\">7</span><span class=\"p\">).</span> <span class=\"err\">%</span> <span class=\"nv\">Returns</span> <span class=\"mi\">10</span></code></pre> </div> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>从函数返回闭包</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>函数可以返回闭包，从而实现函数的动态生成。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>示例：</p> </div> <div class=\"listingblock\"> <div class=\"content\"> <pre class=\"rouge highlight\"><code data-lang=\"erlang\"><span class=\"nf\">make_multiplier</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nv\">N</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span> <span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nv\">X</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span> <span class=\"nv\">X</span> <span class=\"o\">*</span> <span class=\"nv\">N</span> <span class=\"k\">end</span><span class=\"p\">.</span>\n\n<span class=\"nv\">Multiplier</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"nf\">make_multiplier</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">),</span>\n<span class=\"nv\">Result</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"nv\">Multiplier</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">).</span> <span class=\"err\">%</span> <span class=\"nv\">Returns</span> <span class=\"mi\">8</span></code></pre> </div> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>闭包支持动态执行，在高阶函数中十分常用。</p> </div> </div> <div class=\"sect2\"> <h3 id=\"_dynamic_invocation\"><a class=\"link\" data-ref=\"_dynamic_invocation\" href=\"#_dynamic_invocation\">8.6. 动态调用</a></h3> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>可以使用变量在运行时动态调用函数。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>示例：</p> </div> <div class=\"listingblock\"> <div class=\"content\"> <pre class=\"rouge highlight\"><code data-lang=\"erlang\"><span class=\"nv\">M</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">lists</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"nv\">F</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"n\">map</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n<span class=\"nv\">Result</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"nv\">M</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"nv\">F</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nv\">X</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span> <span class=\"nv\">X</span> <span class=\"o\">*</span> <span class=\"mi\">2</span> <span class=\"k\">end</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">,</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">]).</span></code></pre> </div> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>这种动态调用技术比直接调用效率低，但能在运行时灵活选择执行路径。它可以用来实现回调系统：模块导出一组特定的函数，你只需在各处传递模块名即可。由于编译期无法得知调用图，这种技术会让 Dialyzer 之类的分析工具更难发现代码中的错误。</p> </div> </div> <div class=\"sect2\"> <h3 id=\"_higher_order_functions_and_hot_code_loading\"><a class=\"link\" data-ref=\"_higher_order_functions_and_hot_code_loading\" href=\"#_higher_order_functions_and_hot_code_loading\">8.7. 高阶函数与热代码加载</a></h3> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>高阶函数允许动态传递行为，它与热代码加载之间的相互作用很独特。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>示例：</p> </div> <div class=\"listingblock\"> <div class=\"content\"> <pre class=\"rouge highlight\"><code data-lang=\"erlang\"><span class=\"nf\">init</span><span class=\"p\">()</span> <span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"nv\">F</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"o\">?</span><span class=\"nv\">MODULE</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"n\">foo</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"nv\">L</span> <span class=\"o\">=</span> <span class=\"k\">fun</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nv\">X</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span> <span class=\"nf\">foo</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nv\">X</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"k\">end</span><span class=\"p\">,</span>\n  <span class=\"nf\">loop</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nv\">F</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"nv\">L</span><span class=\"p\">).</span>\n\n<span class=\"nf\">foo</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nv\">X</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span> <span class=\"nv\">X</span> <span class=\"o\">+</span> <span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">.</span>\n\n<span class=\"nf\">loop</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nv\">F</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"nv\">L</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"o\">-&gt;</span>\n  <span class=\"nv\">F</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">),</span>\n  <span class=\"nv\">L</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">),</span>\n  <span class=\"nf\">loop</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"nv\">F</span><span class=\"p\">,</span> <span class=\"nv\">L</span><span class=\"p\">).</span></code></pre> </div> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>由于 L 是本地函数，它总是返回 X + 1。如果重新加载该模块，并把 <code>foo/1</code> 改成返回 X + 2，那么 F 就会返回 X + 2。如果两次重新加载该模块，进程就会崩溃，因为 L 引用的是该模块已被清除的版本。</p> </div> </div> <div class=\"sect2\"> <h3 id=\"_conclusion_2\"><a class=\"link\" data-ref=\"_conclusion_2\" href=\"#_conclusion_2\">8.8. 小结</a></h3> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>正如《效率指南》（Efficiency Guide）<sup class=\"footnote\" id=\"_footnote_source-calls-eff-guide-functions-html-function-calls\">[<a class=\"footnote\" data-ref=\"_footnotedef_30\" href=\"#_footnotedef_30\" id=\"_footnoteref_30\">30</a>]</sup> 中所述，Erlang 中函数调用的效率遵循清晰的层级关系：</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>显式调用，无论本地调用还是远程调用（<code>foo()</code>、<code>m:foo()</code>），效率都是最高的。我想补充一点：最高效的调用是同一模块内函数的本地调用，因为这种调用可以在编译期解析，函数也可以被内联。远程调用做不到这一点，因为模块可能在运行时被替换。尽管 JIT 编译器能很好地处理远程调用，但截至 OTP 27，它并不会内联这些调用。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>调用闭包（<code>Fun()</code>、<code>apply(Fun, [])</code>）稍慢一些，但依然高效。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>在编译期就已知参数个数的情况下，应用函数 ()（<code>Mod:Name()</code>、<code>apply(Mod, Name, [])</code>）的效率排在其次。（无法应用未从模块导出的函数。）</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>应用一个参数个数未知的导出函数（<code>apply(Mod, Name, Args)</code>）效率最低。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>Erlang 运行时系统针对本地调用以及指向模块当前版本的远程调用做了优化。热代码加载是一项强大的特性，它让运行中的系统可以在线更新，但也会带来性能上的取舍。同样需要理解的是：两次重新加载同一个模块会清除该模块的旧版本，任何对旧版本的引用都会导致持有该引用的进程崩溃。</p> </div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"footnotes\"><hr><div class=\"footnote\" id=\"_footnotedef_30\"> <a data-ref=\"_footnoteref_30\" href=\"#_footnoteref_30\">30</a>. <a class=\"bare\" href=\"https://www.erlang.org/doc/system/eff_guide_functions.html#function-calls\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.erlang.org/doc/system/eff_guide_functions.html#function-calls</a> </div></div>"}